{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_222_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_222","textTraditional":"一、十年。春王三月，及齊平。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_222_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_222","textTraditional":"二、夏，公會齊侯于頰谷。公至自頰谷。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_222_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_222","textTraditional":"三、晉趙鞅帥師圍衞。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_222_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_222","textTraditional":"四、齊人來歸運、讙、龜陰田。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_222_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_222","textTraditional":"齊人曷為來歸運、讙、龜陰田？孔子行乎季孫，三月不違，齊人為是來歸之。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_222_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_222","textTraditional":"五、叔孫州仇、仲孫何忌帥師圍郈。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_222_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_222","textTraditional":"六、秋，叔孫州仇、仲孫何忌帥師圍費。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_222_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_222","textTraditional":"七、宋樂世心出奔曹。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_cdt_222_9","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_222","textTraditional":"八、宋公子池出奔陳。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_cdt_222_10","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_222","textTraditional":"九、冬，齊侯、衞侯、鄭游遬會于鞌。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_cdt_222_11","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_222","textTraditional":"十、叔孫州仇如齊。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_cdt_222_12","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_222","textTraditional":"十一、齊公之弟辰暨宋仲佗、石彄出奔陳。","sentenceOrder":12}],"overrides":{}}